{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15983","headline":"水夫谣 · 王建","name":"水夫谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦哉生长当驿边，官家使我牵驿船。\n辛苦日多乐日少，水宿沙行如海鸟。\n逆风上水万斛重，前驿迢迢後淼淼。\n半夜缘堤雪和雨，受他驱遣还复去。\n衣寒衣湿披短蓑，臆穿足裂忍痛何。\n到明辛苦无处说，齐声腾踏牵船出。\n一间茆屋何所值，父母之乡去不得。\n我愿此水作平田，长使水夫不怨天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}